{"id":"n54342-1-6","stage":1,"title":"마중 · 接站","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n54342-1-6-1","ko":"지수야, 언제 서울에 도착해?","zh":"智秀，什么时候到首尔？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수야,","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；야：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"지수야","audio":"/audio/933aef68208bc459c4d9.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"언제","meaning":"哪天，哪会儿","explanation":"언제：哪天，哪会儿","readings":[{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17856","senseId":"2","lemma":"언제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"서울에","meaning":"首尔","explanation":"서울：首尔；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"서울에","audio":"/audio/96e9693781c161f4a81f.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"도착해?","meaning":"到达","explanation":"도착하다：到达；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"도착하다","audio":"/audio/a914f00b23a9d60f89e8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70745","senseId":"1","lemma":"도착하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"25f9ca42793d0a69","term":"언제","zh":"哪天，哪会儿","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3","entryId":"17856","definition":"在不明确指定的未来某个时间。","pronunciation":["언ː제"]},{"id":"a914f00b23a9d60f","term":"도착하다","zh":"到达","audio":"/audio/a914f00b23a9d60f89e8.mp3","entryId":"70745","definition":"抵达目的地。","pronunciation":["도ː차카다"]}],"audio":"/audio/8aa133f116f5f2415b3e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n54342-1-6-2","ko":"오후 두 시에 도착하니까 터미널로 마중 나와.","zh":"下午两点到，来长途汽车站接我。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오후","meaning":"下午，午后","explanation":"오후：下午，午后","readings":[{"term":"오후","audio":"/audio/7575a29f7d674595d2a0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67457","senseId":"1","lemma":"오후","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"두","meaning":"两","explanation":"두：两","readings":[{"term":"두","audio":"/audio/dfedd225bb659d500f65.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71458","senseId":"1","lemma":"두","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"시에","meaning":"点，点钟","explanation":"시：点，点钟；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"시","audio":"/audio/bfa42cf6a12e91233038.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65108","senseId":"1","lemma":"시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"도착하니까","meaning":"到达","explanation":"도착하다：到达；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"도착하다","audio":"/audio/a914f00b23a9d60f89e8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70745","senseId":"1","lemma":"도착하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"터미널로","meaning":"总站","explanation":"터미널：总站；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"터미널","audio":"/audio/35644dd12da28567a6c0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72184","senseId":"1","lemma":"터미널","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"마중","meaning":"接站，接机","explanation":"마중：接站，接机","readings":[{"term":"마중","audio":"/audio/810477f1a03c9c2cdb26.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"54342","senseId":"1","lemma":"마중","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나와.","meaning":"到，来到","explanation":"나오다：到，来到；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"3","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"7575a29f7d674595","term":"오후","zh":"下午，午后","audio":"/audio/7575a29f7d674595d2a0.mp3","entryId":"67457","definition":"从中午到太阳落山的期间。","pronunciation":["오ː후"]},{"id":"dfedd225bb659d50","term":"두","zh":"两","audio":"/audio/dfedd225bb659d500f65.mp3","entryId":"71458","definition":"两个的。","pronunciation":["두ː"]},{"id":"bfa42cf6a12e9123","term":"시","zh":"点，点钟","audio":"/audio/bfa42cf6a12e91233038.mp3","entryId":"65108","definition":"计时单位，表示一天二十四小时中的某一个。","pronunciation":["시"]},{"id":"a914f00b23a9d60f","term":"도착하다","zh":"到达","audio":"/audio/a914f00b23a9d60f89e8.mp3","entryId":"70745","definition":"抵达目的地。","pronunciation":["도ː차카다"]},{"id":"35644dd12da28567","term":"터미널","zh":"总站","audio":"/audio/35644dd12da28567a6c0.mp3","entryId":"72184","definitio